OL,3,GNEWSAFamily's move to Portugal delayed
OL,4,Aby premature birth
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family whose move to Portugal had to
OL,7,Fbe delayed after their baby was born 11
OL,8,Fweeks early have thanked the hospital
OL,9,Fthat cared for her during the most
OL,10,F"incredibly challenging time".
OL,12,FBaby Matilde was born at Watford
OL,13,FGeneral Hospital in August at 29 weeks
OL,14,Fand stayed in the care of its neonatal
OL,15,Fteam for 61 days.
OL,17,FHer mother Mafalda said: "They cared
OL,18,Ffor Matilde when she needed them most
OL,19,Fand supported us as parents through an
OL,20,Fincredibly challenging and emotional
OL,21,Ftime."
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
